![fortress2](/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/fortress2-150x150.jpg)

Seriously, this interview with Danish metalheads Förtress came out great! May be you’ve heard of the band from[Vice’s Noisey](http://noisey.vice.com/en_dk/vice-wimp-live-sessions/vice-x-wimp-live-sessions-frtress), who also featured them, but we find about this kickass band through the page of [snowboarder Halldór Helgason](http://helgasons.com/). Förtress’ music is energetic and feisty with a hilarious comedy zest. It’s just so great to see musicians that are having honest fun on the stage (and behind it), instead of taking themselves too seriously. Should I summarize it in few words? Modern twist on the groovy metal at it’s finest.

{% embed provider="youtube" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dfflUHlUq5c" /%}

![](https://scontent-a-lga.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-frc1/t1.0-9/1797517_576067065822665_960297423_n.jpg)

PS: You can still catch few shows of their Denmark tour and the exciting news are they’re playing [Roskilde Festival.](http://roskilde-festival.dk/)

